'''Banette''' (Japanese: '''ジュペッタ''' ''Jupetta'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

