==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Roaring Skies|Banette|31}} from the {{TCG|Roaring Skies}} expansion.
*'''Night Bind''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Stormfront|Duskull|SH2}} from the {{TCG|Stormfront}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

